// ===================== THE VIEW (1 of 2): the sixteen worlds, the karts and the drivers (three.js through tools/world3d.js) =====================
// Every course is its own place, built round the road when the course changes: a real sky and weather (W3), land lifted into
// hills that meet the road, water that reflects, and the course's own things: round trees and flowers, palms and the sea,
// windmills, red rock mesas, cherry trees and a pagoda, snowy pines, jungle ruins over a river, a night city of lit towers,
// pirate ships, lollipops and candy canes, a haunted manor with gravestones, cactus and pyramids, a castle over a lava sea,
// floating islands above the clouds, a moon base under the Earth, a rainbow ribbon through space. The road climbs and dips with
// the land; courses with no walls float over nothing. Karts in six shapes; ten drivers, each a cartoon animal (or robot,
// dragon, alien) with big eyes. Everything that moves is drawn here; part3b places it every frame.
